hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2879","###\n Ya'qub al-Dawraqi narrated to us, saying: Ibn Abi Zaidah narrated to us, saying: Al-A'mash narrated to us. And 'Abd al-Jabbar ibn al-'Ala narrated to us, saying: Sufyan narrated to us, from Al-A'mash, who said: I heard Al-Hajjaj say: \Do not say 'Surat Al-Baqarah'; rather"," say 'The Surah in which the cow is mentioned.'\"" I mentioned this to"""
